# Claude's working-memory vault. Deliberately NOT committed: it is a private
# index over this repo's own memory (STATUS.md, reports.txt, README.md), not a
# source of truth, and it holds candid notes about retracted claims and dead
# hypotheses. Everything in it is reconstructible from the committed docs.
# Cross-machine facts belong in STATUS.md, which IS committed — the Ubuntu box
# cannot see this directory.
vault/
